userContent.text:
Build an interactive figure using SVG.js.

CONCEPT: Insertion sort grows a sorted prefix one element at a time by lifting the next key and sliding it left past every larger element until it lands in its correct place.
KEY INSIGHT (what students should walk away understanding): Each key only has to travel left until it meets something smaller than itself — the sorted prefix guarantees that stopping point is correct, so the total work is exactly the number of out-of-order pairs in the input.
DEMO STEPS: 6 guided steps — implement the step player in #ui

